* К118УД1Б, from the datasheet's principal schematic (eandc.ru k118ud1.pdf):
*   R1, R3 4k collector loads from pin 7; pair bases 3 (out 5) and 10 (out 9);
*   VT3 current source, base pin 12, emitter pin 2, R2 1.8k pin 2 -> pin 14;
*   R4 4k pin 12 -> pin 11, R6 5.7k pin 11 -> pin 8;
*   R5 1.7k pin 12 -> diode-connected transistor -> pin 14.
* Transistor parameters are EST (generic on-chip NPN).
.model QK NPN(IS=1e-15 BF=120 VAF=80 CJE=1p CJC=0.8p TF=0.5n RB=100)
.subckt K118UD1 p2 p3 p5 p7 p8 p9 p10 p11 p12 p14
R1 p7 p5 4k
R3 p7 p9 4k
Q1 p5 p3 tail QK
Q2 p9 p10 tail QK
Q3 tail p12 p2 QK
R2 p2 p14 1.8k
R4 p12 p11 4k
R6 p11 p8 5.7k
R5 p12 nd 1.7k
Q4 nd nd p14 QK
.ends K118UD1
